    <div class="spec-grid">
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">01</span><div class="spec-title">Drag &amp; resize</div><p class="spec-desc">Every edge and corner, with min/max size constraints per item.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">02</span><div class="spec-title">Responsive breakpoints</div><p class="spec-desc">Auto-generate a layout per breakpoint, or hand it exact ones.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">03</span><div class="spec-title">Pluggable compaction</div><p class="spec-desc">Five built-in strategies, or bring your own ICompactor.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">04</span><div class="spec-title">Multi-select &amp; group move</div><p class="spec-desc">Select several items, drag one — the rest move by the same delta.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">05</span><div class="spec-title">Cross-grid drag</div><p class="spec-desc">Drag items between separate grid instances with accept/reject rules.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">06</span><div class="spec-title">Snap &amp; alignment guides</div><p class="spec-desc">Magnetic snapping that adjusts position, not just a visual overlay.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">07</span><div class="spec-title">Persistence &amp; presets</div><p class="spec-desc">Serialize a layout, or save and switch between named presets.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">08</span><div class="spec-title">Keyboard accessible</div><p class="spec-desc">Arrow keys move, shift+arrow resizes — no mouse required.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">09</span><div class="spec-title">TypeScript-first</div><p class="spec-desc">Every prop, event, and enum typed and exported from one entry point.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">10</span><div class="spec-title">Undo / redo</div><p class="spec-desc">Opt-in history at committed-change granularity, not per frame.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">11</span><div class="spec-title">Zero dependencies</div><p class="spec-desc">Native Pointer Events, no bundled drag library to audit.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">12</span><div class="spec-title">SVG export</div><p class="spec-desc">A standalone snapshot of the current layout, no screenshot tooling.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">13</span><div class="spec-title">RTL mirroring</div><p class="spec-desc">Anchor edges, resize direction, and drag math all correctly reverse.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">14</span><div class="spec-title">Framework-agnostic core</div><p class="spec-desc">Positioning and collision logic usable standalone, no framework needed.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">15</span><div class="spec-title">Battle-tested</div><p class="spec-desc">98%+ coverage, Playwright e2e across three browsers, mutation testing.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">16</span><div class="spec-title">Static &amp; locked items</div><p class="spec-desc">Pin specific items in place as fixed obstacles for compaction.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">17</span><div class="spec-title">Align &amp; distribute</div><p class="spec-desc">Align a multi-selection to an edge, or evenly space what's between.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">18</span><div class="spec-title">Spacing indicators</div><p class="spec-desc">A labeled distance badge to the nearest neighbor while dragging.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">19</span><div class="spec-title">Custom header slot</div><p class="spec-desc">A separate, own-scrolling header region above an item's own content.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">20</span><div class="spec-title">Per-item zIndex</div><p class="spec-desc">Pin one panel permanently above every other, even mid-drag.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">21</span><div class="spec-title">Outside drag &amp; drop</div><p class="spec-desc">Accept a native HTML5 drag from entirely outside the grid system.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">22</span><div class="spec-title">Localizable ARIA strings</div><p class="spec-desc">Every keyboard/screen-reader string overridable, per grid or per item.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">23</span><div class="spec-title">Custom drag handles</div><p class="spec-desc">Restrict dragging to your own handle instead of the whole item.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">24</span><div class="spec-title">Configurable height modes</div><p class="spec-desc">Auto, fixed, or scrolling container sizing — not just grow-to-fit.</p></div>
